{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 33,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rejoice in Jehovah, O ye righteous:\nPraise is comely for the upright.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Give thanks unto Jehovah with the harp:\nSing praises unto him with the psaltery of ten strings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing unto him a new song;\nPlay skilfully with a loud noise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the word of Jehovah is right;\nAnd all his work is ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "done",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in faithfulness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He loveth righteousness and justice:\nThe earth is full of the lovingkindness of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By the word of Jehovah were the heavens made,\nAnd all the host of them by the breath of his mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He gathereth the waters of the sea together as a heap:\nHe layeth up the deeps in store-houses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let all the earth fear Jehovah:\nLet all the inhabitants of the world stand in awe of him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he spake, and it was done;\nHe commanded, and it stood fast.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah bringeth the counsel of the nations to nought;\nHe maketh the thoughts of the peoples to be of no effect.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The counsel of Jehovah standeth fast for ever,\nThe thoughts of his heart to all generations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed is the nation whose God is Jehovah,\nThe people whom he hath chosen for his own inheritance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah looketh from heaven;\nHe beholdeth all the sons of men;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From the place of his habitation he looketh forth\nUpon all the inhabitants of the earth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that fashioneth the hearts of them all,\nThat considereth all their works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is no king saved by the multitude of a host:\nA mighty man is not delivered by great strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A horse is a vain thing for safety;\nNeither doth he deliver any by his great power.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, the eye of Jehovah is upon them that fear him,\nUpon them that hope in his lovingkindness;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To deliver their soul from death,\nAnd to keep them alive in famine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our soul hath waited for Jehovah:\nHe is our help and our shield.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For our heart shall rejoice in him,\nBecause we have trusted in his holy name.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.33.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.33.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thy lovingkindness, O Jehovah, be upon us,\nAccording as we have hoped in thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Praise to the Creator and Preserver.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
